# Login Feature

## Successful Login
* Navigate to login page
* Enter valid username "Admin" and password "admin123"
* Click the login button
* Verify user is logged in successfully

## Unsuccessful Login
* Navigate to login page
* Enter invalid username "wrongAdmin" and password "wrongPassword"
* Click the login button
* verify error message is displayed

## Successful logout
* Navigate to login page
* Enter valid username "Admin" and password "admin123"
* Click the login button
* Click on Logout button